WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:04,500
If you stay far away, you will be interrupted.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,940
Too close and afraid of rear-end collision

3
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:11,300
Fortunately, I have you, Xiaoxiao, with me

4
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:16,670
Otherwise, Liu Yang and I wouldn't care about Yueyue and we should have been poisoned to death.

5
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:18,230
You can only take it slow first

6
00:00:18,390 --> 00:00:21,230
There's still 1.2 kilometers to the exit. Let me drive.

7
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:23,230
You should drink some water and take a rest.

8
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:25,350
If there is no traffic jam

9
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:28,270
I can drive a few hundred kilometers without any problem, that’s for sure

10
00:00:28,670 --> 00:00:30,030
You drive more steadily than me

11
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:37,130
Little sister, don’t look at it either.

12
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:38,370
Will have nightmares

13
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:39,730
We don’t want to watch it
